<title>NEW ZEALAND: ADVISORY-NZFOE trading halted until further notice.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY-NZFOE trading halted until further notice.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Futures and Options Exchange on Friday advised that its computer trading system was halted due to communication problems.</p>
<p>NZFOE's Greg Boland said inter-office trading would continue until further notice.</p>
<p>Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
